 * program trace
 * enqueue (queue, 10): queue= {10}
 * enqueue (queue,20): queue={10,20}
 * enqueue (queue,30): queue={10,20,30}
 * enqueue(queue,40): queue={10,20,30,40}
 * enqueue(queue, 50): queue={10,20,30,40,50}
 * displays the queue={10,20,30,40,50}
 * dequeue(queue): queue= {_,20,30,40,50}, front points to 20
 * dequeue(queue): queue={_,_,,30,40,50}, front points to 30, rear points to 50
 * enqueue(60): queue={60,_,30,40,50}, front points to 30, rear wraps around 
 * enqueue(70): queue={60,70,30,40,50}, front points to 30, rear points to 70
 * display: loop runs from front to rear using i=(i+1)%5
 * displays: 
 * 30   40  50  60  70
 * ****************************************************************************/
